COLLECTIONS: Engineering, Q3 Planning

RELEVANT ENTITY TYPES (existing types — do not recreate; do not copy their fields onto a new type):
- ticket "Ticket" -> title: text, required; status: enum {ready_for_dev, in_dev, ready_for_review, in_review, done}, required; assignee: text; sprint: text [title_template: {title}]
- adr "ADR" -> title: text, required; status: enum {proposed, accepted, superseded}, required; supersedes: text

RELATED (via relationship, not directly matched):
- release: Release

